TI  - Effect of temperature and sucrose on Ulluco (Ullucus tuberosus Caldas) microtuber production under neutral photoperiodic conditions
PY  - 2004
T2  - Advances in Horticultural Science
VL  - 18
IS  - 4
SP  - 207
